---
layout: base.njk
title: "DUE — Essays"
includeCountdown: true
---
<section class="hero card">
  <h2 style="margin-top:0">Publish under pressure.</h2>
  <p>One topic. Thirty days. Essays go live finished or not. Minor contributions are acknowledged; major ones earn coauthorship. Every essay evolves with semantic versioning.</p>
  <div class="cta-row">
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ site.repoUrl }}/issues/new?template=new-essay.yml">Start a new essay</a>
    <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="{{ site.repoUrl }}/issues/new?template=suggest-change.yml">Suggest a change</a>
  </div>
</section>

{% set drafts = collections.draftEssays %}
<h2>In Progress</h2>
{% if drafts.length %}
  {% set active = drafts[0] %}
  <div class="card in-progress" data-deadline="{{ active.data.deadline_at }}">
    <h3>Currently writing: {{ active.data.title }}</h3>
    <div class="meta">
      {% if active.data.word_range %}<span class="badge">{{ active.data.word_range }} words</span>{% endif %}
      {% if active.data.started_at %}<span>Started: {{ active.data.started_at | date("yyyy-LL-dd") }}</span>{% endif %}
      {% if active.data.deadline_at %}<span>Publishes: {{ active.data.deadline_at | date("yyyy-LL-dd") }}</span>{% endif %}
    </div>
    <p class="countdown">
      <span data-countdown>
        {% if active.data.deadline_at %}
          Publishes at {{ active.data.deadline_at | date("yyyy-LL-dd") }}
        {% else %}
          Deadline not yet scheduled.
        {% endif %}
      </span>
    </p>
    {% if active.data.topic %}<p><strong>Topic:</strong> {{ active.data.topic }}</p>{% endif %}
  </div>
  {% if drafts.length > 1 %}
    <div class="card">
      <h4>Also drafting</h4>
      <ul class="draft-list">
        {% for draft in drafts %}
          {% if not loop.first %}
          <li>
            <strong>{{ draft.data.title }}</strong>
            {% if draft.data.deadline_at %} — publishes {{ draft.data.deadline_at | date("yyyy-LL-dd") }}{% endif %}
          </li>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  {% endif %}
{% else %}
  <div class="card">
    <p>No drafts in progress. Start a new essay to begin writing.</p>
  </div>
{% endif %}

<h2>Published Essays</h2>
{% for post in collections.publishedEssays %}
  <div class="card">
    <h3><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h3>
      <div class="meta">
        <span class="badge">v{{ post.data.version }}</span>
        <span class="badge">{{ post.data.word_range }} words</span>
        <span class="badge">
          {% if post.data.initial_status == "complete" %}
            Published completed
          {% else %}
            Published unfinished
          {% endif %}
        </span>
        {% if post.data.published_at %}<span>Published: {{ post.data.published_at | date("yyyy-LL-dd") }}</span>{% endif %}
      </div>
    {% if post.data.release_notes and post.data.release_notes.length %}
      <p><strong>Latest:</strong> {{ post.data.release_notes[0] }}</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
{% else %}
  <p>No essays published yet.</p>
{% endfor %}

<hr>

<h2>About</h2>
<p><strong>DUE — Deadline for Unfinished Essays</strong> publishes short essays under a 30‑day deadline. Finished or not, they go live. Minor contributions are acknowledged; major contributions earn coauthorship. Essays evolve using semantic versioning.</p>
